# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CatLium EduTech — Python dependency lock (pip-tools)
#
# The UNION of every direct dependency declared across the three Python
# packages (apps/ocr/pyproject.toml, apps/workers/pyproject.toml,
# apps/workers/ocr-worker/pyproject.toml). The Docker images install ONLY
# this lockfile for third-party deps, then `pip install --no-deps` their own
# code — so the heavy paddle/OpenCV layer is cached and rebuilt only when
# this file changes.
#
# Regenerate (requires pip-tools):
#   python3 -m venv /tmp/pipcompile && /tmp/pipcompile/bin/pip install -q pip-tools
#   cd infrastructure/compose && /tmp/pipcompile/bin/pip-compile requirements.in -o requirements.lock
#
# If you add a dependency to one of the pyprojects, add it here too and
# recompile — otherwise images silently miss it (deps come from this lock).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# apps/ocr
fastapi>=0.115.0
uvicorn[standard]>=0.34.0
pydantic>=2.11.0
pydantic-settings>=2.9.0
httpx>=0.28.0
python-multipart>=0.0.12
numpy>=1.26.0
pillow>=10.0.0
pymupdf>=1.24.0
paddlepaddle>=3.0.0
paddleocr>=3.0.0

# apps/workers
pika>=1.3.2
psycopg[binary]>=3.2.0

